{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Available Methods"}], "prev": {"link": "../create_group/", "title": "create_group()"}, "next": {"link": "../delete_channel/", "title": "delete_channel()"}, "title": "create_supergroup()", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"create-supergroup\">\n<h1>create_supergroup()<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#create-supergroup\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.Client.create_supergroup\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">Client.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">create_supergroup</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.Client.create_supergroup\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Create a new supergroup.</p>\n<div class=\"admonition note\">\n<p class=\"admonition-title\">Note</p>\n<p>If you want to create a new basic group, use <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../create_group/#pyrogram.Client.create_group\" title=\"pyrogram.Client.create_group\"><code class=\"xref py py-meth docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">create_group()</span></code></a> instead.</p>\n</div>\n<strong>Usable by</strong>\n<span class=\"usable-by\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\" style=\"color: var(--color-green)\"></i> Users</span>\n<span class=\"usable-by\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\" style=\"color: var(--color-red)\"></i> Bots</span><dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>title</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>) \u2013 The supergroup title.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>description</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 The supergroup description.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>message_auto_delete_time</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Message auto-delete time value, in seconds; must be from 0 up to 365 * 86400 and be divisible by 86400. If 0, then messages aren\u2019t deleted automatically.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>is_forum</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Pass True to create a forum supergroup chat. Defaults to False.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../types/Chat/#pyrogram.types.Chat\" title=\"pyrogram.types.Chat\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Chat</span></code></a> \u2013 On success, a chat object is returned.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Example</p>\n<div class=\"highlight-python notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"k\">await</span> <span class=\"n\">app</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">create_supergroup</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;Supergroup Title&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;Supergroup Description&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["api/methods/delete_channel", "delete_channel()", "N", "next"], ["api/methods/create_group", "create_group()", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">create_supergroup()</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#pyrogram.Client.create_supergroup\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Client.create_supergroup()</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "api/methods/create_supergroup", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navigation_tree": "", "furo_hide_toc": false, "furo_pygments": {"light": {"background": "#eeffcc", "foreground": "black"}, "dark": {"background": "#202020", "foreground": "#d0d0d0"}}}